			"notes": "Optional Fabric mod for DonutSMP. Shares the Auction, Orders and Quick Buy menus and the leaderboards you open with [DonutMarket](https://donutmarket.cc/share), so its prices stay up to date.\n\n**Download the jar for your Minecraft version:**\n\n| Minecraft | Jar |\n|---|---|\n| 26.3 | `priceshare-1.0.2+mc26.3.jar` |\n| 26.2 | `priceshare-1.0.2+mc26.2.jar` |\n| 26.1 – 26.1.2 | `priceshare-1.0.2+mc26.1.jar` |\n| 1.21.11 | `priceshare-1.0.2+mc1.21.11.jar` |\n\nNeeds Fabric Loader only, no Fabric API.\n\n- Off until you say yes, and you can turn it off any time.\n- Never clicks, opens menus or sends commands, and does nothing on other servers.\n- Your Minecraft login stays with Mojang. See [PROTOCOL.md](PROTOCOL.md) for exactly what's sent."
